Note: in Everquest Legends it is possible to become non-KOS with both [[King Xorbb]]<nowiki> and the []Pickclaw Goblins]]. If you ruin you faction by hunting in the Runnyeye basement, you can kill Mudittes and Minotaurs in </nowiki>[[Gorge of King Xorbb]] to improve your Goblin faction without completely tanking your [[King Xorbb]] faction.

